.TH FASTAPI\-CLOUD\-SETUP\-CI "1" "March 2026" "" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
.B fastapi\ cloud\ setup\-ci
\(en Configures a GitHub Actions workflow for deploying the app
on push to the specified branch.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fastapi\ cloud\ setup\-ci
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.RI [ PATH ]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-branch, \-b\ \fITEXT
Branch that triggers deploys
(defaults to the repo\(cqs default branch).
.TP
.B \-\-secrets\-only, \-s
Provisions token and sets secrets,
skips writing the workflow file.
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run, \-d
Prints steps that would be taken without actually performing them.
.TP
.B \-\-file, \-f\ \fITEXT
Custom workflow filename
(written to
.BR .github/workflows/ )
.TP
.B \-\-help\fR, \fB\-h
Show a help message and exit.
.SS "ARGUMENTS"
.TP
.I PATH
Path to the folder containing the app (defaults to current directory).
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
.B #\ Provisions\ token,\ sets\ secrets,\ and\ writes\ workflow\ file\ for\ the\ \(oqmain\(cq
.B #\ branch
.B fastapi\ cloud\ setup\-ci
.EE
.P
.EX
.B #\ Same\ as\ above\ but\ for\ the \(oqdevelop\(cq\ branch
.B fastapi\ cloud\ setup\-ci\ \-\-branch\ develop
.EE
.P
.EX
.B #\ Only\ provisions\ token\ and\ sets\ secrets,\ does\ not\ write\ workflow\ file
.B fastapi\ cloud\ setup\-ci\ \-\-secrets\-only
.EE
.P
.EX
.B #\ Prints\ the\ steps\ that\ would\ be\ taken\ without\ performing\ them
.B fastapi\ cloud\ setup\-ci\ \-\-dry\-run
.EE
.P
.EX
.B #\ Writes\ workflow\ to\ .github/workflows/ci.yml
.B fastapi\ cloud\ setup\-ci\ \-\-file\ ci.yml
.EE
.SH "SEE ALSO"
